# A HALL DEEP UNDER THE CAVES' ROOF (GenAbove), no tear within 16 tiles: what the
# cave's own light shows of the ground and the nearest walls, over the shoulder
# at four headings, and from above.
#   TOUR_FIXED_FPS=60 tools/tour.sh tours/cave-dark.tour --seed=7 --realm=underground --hour=12
coast calm
wait 1.0
near deep_under_roof
wait 1.5
shot 01-deep-hall-from-above
tap shoulder
await shoulder 20
wait 1.0
shot 02-heading-0 with shoulder
mouse 640,0 0.6
wait 0.8
shot 03-heading-1 with shoulder
mouse 640,0 0.6
wait 0.8
shot 04-heading-2 with shoulder
mouse 640,0 0.6
wait 0.8
shot 05-heading-3 with shoulder
